Hi Folks,

I am going to talk about Bluetooth and Linux at the FFG 2004 of the
German Unix User Group (GUUG). It is a 4 day congress which takes place
from March, 9th to 12th in Bochum, Germany. My talk is in German, so
there may be only limited interest, but I want to announce it anyway.
More details can be found on the congress website

	http://www.guug.de/veranstaltungen/ffg2004/

Regards

Marcel




